  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 7.26,
   "end": 23.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "So, after seven hundred and thirty-one grueling galactic weeks of travel, or one month if you never watched “Men in Black\", our... ahem... \"heroes\"... have finally arrived on Planet Namek, where the sky is green, the grass is blue, and it’s boring as s**t."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 24.2,
   "end": 27.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Hey, Gohan, check it out! Blue grass."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 27.7,
   "end": 29.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "What do you think their favorite kind of music is?"
  },
