   "end": 283.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Roshi",
   "text": "And not only is Vegeta on the planet, but apparently someone else is there, even stronger than *him*!"
  },
  {
   "i": 111,
   "start": 283.3,
   "end": 286.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Roshi",
   "text": "So in short: s**t be whack, yo!"
  },
  {
   "i": 112,
   "start": 286.02,
   "end": 287.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Fo shizzle, Master Rizzle!"
  },
  {
   "i": 113,
   "start": 287.54,
   "end": 292.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "But I can’t do anything until I’m fully healed, though! If only there were a way…"
  },
  {
   "i": 114,
   "start": 292.82,
   "end": 298.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yajirobe",
   "text": "Hey there, I thought I’d just drop in with these magical Senzu Beans that heal all wounds and restore your stamina."
  },
  {
   "i": 115,
   "start": 300.0,
   "end": 301.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "...If only there were a w--"
  },
  {
   "i": 116,
   "start": 301.74,
   "end": 304.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Roshi",
   "text": "Take the damn magical beans, Goku!"
  },
  {
   "i": 117,
   "start": 304.42,
   "end": 306.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Ooh! Sweet science-y magic!"
  },
  {
   "i": 118,
   "start": 306.5,
   "end": 312.36,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "♪♪ Popeye Theme ♪♪"
  },
  {
   "i": 119,
   "start": 312.36,
   "end": 313.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Naked time!"
  },
  {
   "i": 120,
   "start": 314.48,
   "end": 315.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Alright!"
  },
  {
   "i": 121,
   "start": 315.78,
   "end": 318.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "‘Kay guys, I’m goin’ to Bulma’s place!"
  },
  {
   "i": 122,
   "start": 318.5,
   "end": 320.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "By the way, takin’ the beans."
  },
  {
   "i": 123,
   "start": 320.3,
   "end": 320.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Roshi",
   "text": "Krillin?"
  },
  {
   "i": 124,
   "start": 320.94,
   "end": 321.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Krillin."
  },
  {
   "i": 125,
   "start": 321.68,
   "end": 323.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Roshi",
   "text": "But… why Bulma’s?"
  },
  {
   "i": 126,
   "start": 323.38,
   "end": 327.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Well, I need a ship and Bulma’s dad’s a scientist."
  },
  {
   "i": 127,
   "start": 327.9,
   "end": 333.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Roshi",
   "text": "...I’m not even gonna *begin* to go into what is wrong with that. I just wish you good luck!"
  },
  {
   "i": 128,
   "start": 333.46,
   "end": 334.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Nimbus!"
  },
  {
   "i": 129,
   "start": 334.96,
   "end": 335.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Later, guys!"
  },
  {
   "i": 130,
   "start": 337.1,
   "end": 337.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Nimbus?"
  },
  {
   "i": 131,
   "start": 338.06,
   "end": 339.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Nimb--Ohgodohcrapohgeezoh--"
  },
  {
   "i": 132,
   "start": 339.9,
   "end": 342.26,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Crash, car alarm"
  },
  {
   "i": 133,
   "start": 342.26,
   "end": 343.62,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "I’m okay…"
  },
  {
   "i": 134,
   "start": 343.62,
   "end": 344.44,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Nimbus noise"
  },
  {
   "i": 135,
   "start": 344.44,
   "end": 346.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Oh… There he is."
  },
  {
   "i": 136,
   "start": 346.02,
   "end": 348.14,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Alarm"
  },
  {
   "i": 137,
   "start": 348.14,
   "end": 348.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Roshi",
   "text": "(Sigh)..."
  },
  {
   "i": 138,
   "start": 352.9,
   "end": 356.54,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Rapid Scouter beeps"
  },
  {
   "i": 139,
   "start": 352.9,
   "end": 356.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Cui",
   "text": "Hello there, Vegeta. Fancy meeting you here."
  },
  {
   "i": 140,
   "start": 356.66,
   "end": 359.52,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "So you followed me? Sure took your sweet time."
  },
  {
   "i": 141,
   "start": 359.52,
   "end": 364.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Cui",
   "text": "Well, I could’ve gotten here sooner, but I stopped on my way to plow YOUR mother!"
  },
  {
   "i": 142,
   "start": 365.24,
   "end": 366.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "My mother's dead."
  },
  {
   "i": 143,
   "start": 366.5,
   "end": 367.84,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Cui",
   "text": "*I know*."
  },
  {
   "i": 144,
   "start": 368.08,
   "end": 369.1,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Wind blows quietly"
  },
  {
   "i": 145,
   "start": 369.1,
   "end": 371.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "You know, I’m having trouble remembering, Cui."
  },
  {
   "i": 146,
   "start": 371.46,
   "end": 372.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "What’s your power level?"
  },
  {
   "i": 147,
   "start": 372.88,
   "end": 378.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Cui",
   "text": "HAH! You would forget! 18,000. Same as yours, Vegeta."
  },
  {
   "i": 148,
   "start": 378.48,
   "end": 388.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Funny that. See, I just read my Official Saiyan Handbook, and it says right here: “When a Saiyan is beaten to near death, their power level increases immensely.”"
  },
  {
   "i": 149,
   "start": 388.88,
   "end": 391.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Cui",
   "text": "Well, I don’t see what that has to do with anything--"
  },
  {
   "i": 150,
   "start": 391.42,
   "end": 396.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "And while I was down on Earth, oh man... I got des*troyed*!"
  },
  {
   "i": 151,
   "start": 396.44,
   "end": 398.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Cui",
   "text": "HA HA HA, you... what?"
  },
  {
   "i": 152,
   "start": 398.44,
   "end": 399.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Yep..."
  },
  {
   "i": 153,
   "start": 399.46,
   "end": 405.84,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "All by a low-level warrior, his half-breed son, a midget, and an obese man with a sword."
  },
  {
   "i": 154,
   "start": 406.36,
   "end": 407.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "I lost outright."
  },
  {
   "i": 155,
   "start": 407.96,
   "end": 409.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Cui",
   "text": "Why are you telling me this?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 156,
   "start": 409.66,
   "end": 411.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Cui",
   "text": "You'd never tell anyone this!"
  },
  {
   "i": 157,
   "start": 411.44,
   "end": 414.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Easy. Because I know you’ll never tell anybody, Cui."
  },
  {
   "i": 158,
   "start": 414.86,
   "end": 418.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Cui",
   "text": "But-- but I hate you! Why would I-- AAAAAAAGH!!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 159,
   "start": 421.42,
   "end": 422.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "God, I love therapy!"
  },
  {
   "i": 160,
   "start": 423.38,
   "end": 424.14,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "POOF"
  },
  {
   "i": 161,
   "start": 423.38,
   "end": 424.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 162,
   "start": 424.74,
   "end": 427.3,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "Oh my, I seem to have gone off prematurely."
  },
  {
   "i": 163,
   "start": 427.3,
   "end": 432.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dodoria",
   "text": "Well, hell. Looks like Vegeta just took out Cui. Poor fish-faced bastard."
  },
  {
   "i": 164,
   "start": 432.14,
   "end": 433.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "Wait, which one was Cui?"
  },
  {
   "i": 165,
   "start": 433.72,
   "end": 437.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dodoria",
   "text": "You remember. Purple guy, hated Vegeta."
  },
  {
   "i": 166,
   "start": 437.34,
   "end": 439.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "Gonna have to be a little more specific."
  },
  {
   "i": 167,
   "start": 439.22,
   "end": 440.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dodoria",
   "text": "Reproduced asexually."
  },
  {
   "i": 168,
   "start": 440.52,
   "end": 442.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "Oh, him. Ew."
  },
  {
   "i": 169,
   "start": 442.26,
   "end": 448.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "You know, I wouldn’t have minded so much if he wasn’t all up in my face about it. I can only swallow so much."
  },
  {
   "i": 170,
   "start": 448.26,
   "end": 454.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Will you two pay attention? These innocent bumpkins won’t slaughter themselves."
  },
  {
   "i": 171,
   "start": 454.12,
   "end": 456.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "Well, you might be able to find a way to make them."
  },
  {
   "i": 172,
   "start": 456.88,
   "end": 461.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Oooh, that’d be *fun*! Heeheeheeheeheehee!"
  },
  {
   "i": 173,
   "start": 462.14,
   "end": 464.62,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "A new evil has revealed its face."
  },
  {
   "i": 174,
   "start": 465.0,
   "end": 467.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "Who are these mysterious enemies?"
  },
  {
   "i": 175,
   "start": 467.58,
   "end": 470.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "And do Gohan and Krillin stand a chance?"
  },
  {
   "i": 176,
   "start": 471.0,
   "end": 475.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "The answer to these questions will be revealed… right now!"
  },
  {
   "i": 177,
   "start": 475.0,
   "end": 478.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "* Zarbon * Dodoria * Freeza * And ohhh myyy, no."
  },
  {
   "i": 178,
   "start": 478.78,
   "end": 479.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Wait, what--?"
  },
  {
   "i": 179,
   "start": 479.32,
   "end": 481.8,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "♫ Closing theme (DBZ intermission) ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 180,
   "start": 481.8,
   "end": 483.76,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Captions by PyroAvok"
  },
  {
   "i": 181,
   "start": 484.42,
   "end": 487.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Kai",
   "text": "Alright, now that you have arrived on my planet we will begin your training."
  },
  {
   "i": 182,
   "start": 487.92,
   "end": 490.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Kai",
   "text": "Tenshinhan, Chiaotzu; twenty laps around the planet."
  },
  {
   "i": 183,
   "start": 491.32,
   "end": 491.82,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Kai",
   "text": "Piccolo?"
  },
  {
   "i": 184,
   "start": 491.82,
   "end": 493.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Go to hell, I’m meditating."
  },
  {
   "i": 185,
   "start": 493.28,
   "end": 494.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Kai",
   "text": "Keep doing that."
  },
  {
   "i": 186,
   "start": 494.18,
   "end": 494.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Kai",
   "text": "Yamcha?"
  },
  {
   "i": 187,
   "start": 494.78,
   "end": 497.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yamcha",
   "text": "What is it, King Kai? I’m ready for anything!"
  },
  {
   "i": 188,
   "start": 497.64,
   "end": 498.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Kai",
   "text": "Wash my car."
  },
  {
   "i": 189,
   "start": 498.74,
   "end": 500.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yamcha",
   "text": "Oooh! Like in that movie!"
  },
  {
   "i": 190,
   "start": 500.82,
   "end": 502.56,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yamcha",
   "text": "Wax on, or wax off!"
  },
  {
   "i": 191,
   "start": 503.12,
   "end": 504.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Kai",
   "text": "Yeah, go \"wax off\"."
  }
 ],
